INSERT INTO `ld_automaticreminds` VALUES (1,64,'回款计划预置提醒','ld_paymentplan:plandate:plandate:PaymentPlan_fieldlabel',NULL,1,2,0,'1','回款计划到期，请及时催收！公司名称：[var.paymentplan_account_id_PaymentPlan]，\r\n期次：[var.paymentplan_periodtime_PaymentPlan]，金额：[var.paymentplan_amount_PaymentPlan]',1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,40,NULL,'no',NULL,1),(2,79,'付款计划预置提醒','ld_sendpayment:plandate:plandate:SendPayment_fieldlabel',NULL,1,2,0,'1','付款计划到期，请及时付款！供应商名称：[var.sendpayment_vendor_id_SendPayment]，期次：[var.sendpayment_cpperiodtime_SendPayment]，金额：[var.sendpayment_amount_SendPayment]',1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,41,NULL,'no',NULL,2),(3,102,'最晚服务到期日前30天邮件提醒客户','ld_account:lastservicedate:lastservicedate:ServiceCharge_fieldlabel',NULL,1,2,NULL,'Accounts','<p>您的服务还有30天即将已经到期，请联系您的服务人员：[var.account_servicecasher_ServiceCharge]</p>',2,1,NULL,'2017-09-30 10:14:39',NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'no',NULL,3),(4,4,'联系人生日提醒','ld_contactdetails:birthday:birthday:Contacts_fieldlabel',NULL,0,3,0,'Contacts','尊敬的客户，今天是您的生日，在这特殊的日子里，祝您生日快乐，幸福安康！更多服务请来电，我们随时为您服务！',2,1,NULL,'2019-01-15 14:59:09',NULL,2,NULL,NULL,'no',NULL,4),(5,55,'拜访日期提醒','ld_contactrecords:nextcontactdate:nextcontactdate:ContactRecords_fieldlabel',NULL,3,2,NULL,'1','<p>你有一条拜访记录需要跟进！</p>',1,1,NULL,'2020-03-20 19:34:08',NULL,0,NULL,'','no',NULL,5),(6,55,'122','ld_contactrecordscf:cf_3582:cf_3582:ContactRecords_fieldlabel',NULL,1,2,NULL,'1','<p>123<br/></p>',1,1,NULL,'2020-04-03 19:27:40',NULL,0,NULL,'','no',NULL,6),(7,67,'销售工作周报','ld_expense:createdtime:createdtime:Expense_fieldlabel','2020-04-10 00:00:00',2,1,1,'1','<p>请查看[var.expensescf_cf_3607_Expense] 工作周报中的待办事项，请及时跟进，谢谢~&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</span></p><p>工作简报如下：\r\n[var.expensescf_cf_3558_Expense]</p>',2,1,1,'2020-04-07 11:47:51','2020-10-10 10:47:20',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,7),(8,133,'拜访报告','ld_addjobbillscf:cf_3612:cf_3612:AddJobBill_fieldlabel','2020-04-10 00:00:00',2,1,1,'1','<p>请查看客户[var.addjobbill_account_id_AddJobBill]的拜访报告中的待办事项，如有，请及时跟进，谢谢~&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</span></p><p>拜访记录如下：[var.addjobbillscf_cf_3615_AddJobBill]</p><p><br/></p>',1,1,1,'2020-04-09 13:54:24','2020-10-10 10:51:04',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,8),(9,13,'客户服务工单','ld_troubletickets:createdtime:createdtime:HelpDesk_fieldlabel','2020-04-14 00:00:00',2,1,1,'specifyuser','<p>您有新的客户服务工单需要审批，请及时处理，谢谢~</p><p>[var.troubletickets_account_id_HelpDesk]&nbsp;</p><p>[var.ticketcf_cf_3250_HelpDesk]&nbsp;</p><p>FAE：[var.troubletickets_assigned_user_id_HelpDesk]</p>',1,1,1,'2020-04-13 18:10:17','2020-10-10 10:48:51',1,NULL,'1','no',NULL,9),(10,20,'报价单审批提醒','ld_quotescf:cf_3381:cf_3381:Quotes_fieldlabel','2020-09-23 00:00:00',2,1,1,'1','<p>您有[var.quotes_account_id_Quotes]的报价单[var.quotes_quote_no_Quotes]还是未批准状态，请及时跟进，谢谢~</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</span></p>',1,1,1,'2020-09-22 15:06:06','2020-10-10 10:50:00',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,10),(11,22,'订单审批提醒','ld_salesorder:signed_data:signed_data:SalesOrder_fieldlabel','2020-09-23 00:00:00',2,1,1,'1','<p>客户[var.salesorder_account_id_SalesOrder]的订单[var.salesorder_salesorder_no_SalesOrder]，还是未批准状态，请及时处理，谢谢~&nbsp;</p><p>此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</p>',1,1,1,'2020-09-22 15:08:36','2020-10-10 10:50:13',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,11),(12,153,'样品审批提醒','ld_customform11:createdtime:createdtime:CustomForm11_fieldlabel','2020-09-23 00:00:00',2,1,1,'1','<p>您有[var.customform11_account_id_CustomForm11]的样品申请单[var.customform11_customform11_no_CustomForm11]还是未批准状态，请及时处理，谢谢~</p><p>此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</p>',1,1,1,'2020-09-22 15:10:13','2020-10-10 10:49:02',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,12),(13,37,'NRE 订单审批提醒','ld_servicecontracts:due_date:due_date:ServiceContracts_fieldlabel',NULL,2,1,1,'1','<p>您有[var.servicecontracts_account_id_ServiceContracts]的NRE 订单[var.servicecontracts_contract_no_ServiceContracts]还是未批准状态，请及时跟进，谢谢~</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</span></p>',2,1,1,'2020-10-10 10:36:33','2020-10-10 10:49:34',1,NULL,'','no',NULL,13),(14,2,'立项通知','ld_potential:createdtime:createdtime:Potentials_fieldlabel',NULL,1,1,1,'1','<p>客户[var.potential_account_id_Potentials]已创建S2 销售机会，如项目顺利，请及时立项，谢谢~&nbsp;</p><p>此邮件为系统邮件，请及时跟进，谢谢~</p>',1,1,NULL,'2020-10-10 10:54:52',NULL,1,NULL,'','no',NULL,14),(15,164,'Forecast 通知','ld_customform22scf:cf_3740:cf_3740:CustomForm22_fieldlabel',NULL,1,1,1,'1','<p>客户[var.customform22_account_id_CustomForm22]已创建S3 立项项目，请尽快创建S4 量产项目，以便整理销售预测数据，谢谢~\r\n此邮件为系统邮件，请勿直接回复，谢谢~</p>',1,1,NULL,'2020-10-10 10:56:41',NULL,1,NULL,'','no',NULL,15);
